> legendre 0 7
(0/7) = 0
  the top is divisible by the bottom
  how: quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)
  check: Euler's criterion 0^((7-1)/2) = 0 mod 7
> legendre 2 7
(2/7) = 1
  a quadratic residue: x^2 = a has a solution
  (4^2 = 2 mod 7)
  how: quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)
  check: Euler's criterion 2^((7-1)/2) = 1 mod 7
> legendre 3 11
(3/11) = 1
  a quadratic residue: x^2 = a has a solution
  (5^2 = 3 mod 11)
  how: quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)
  check: Euler's criterion 3^((11-1)/2) = 1 mod 11
> legendre -1 13
(-1/13) = 1
  a quadratic residue: x^2 = a has a solution
  (8^2 = 12 mod 13)
  how: quadratic reciprocity (the binary Jacobi algorithm)
  check: Euler's criterion 12^((13-1)/2) = 1 mod 13
> legendre 2 9
  note: 9 is not prime: the Legendre symbol is not defined; this is the Jacobi symbol
(2/9) = 1
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 9 = 3^2
  9 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 2 is not a square mod 9
> jacobi 2 15
(2/15) = 1
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 15 = 3 * 5
  15 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 2 is not a square mod 15
> jacobi 3 9
(3/9) = 0
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 9 = 3^2
  9 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 3 is not a square mod 9
> jacobi 5 21
(5/21) = 1
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 21 = 3 * 7
  21 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 5 is not a square mod 21
> jacobi 2 561
(2/561) = 1
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 561 = 3 * 11 * 17
  561 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 2 is not a square mod 561
> jacobi -1 1001
(-1/1001) = 1
  how: quadratic reciprocity; the product of the Legendre symbols over 1001 = 7 * 11 * 13
  1001 is composite: (a/n) = 1 does not make a a square mod n; here 1000 is not a square mod 1001
